| Dash handling
| This is to recognize certain patterns as informal representations of
| em dash (U+2014), and remove ordinary spaces surrounding such dashes
| 1;1 2014-10-27 J E Sullivan
| single (ordinary) hyphen - only when surrounded by ordinary spaces
 - ~|236D~
| single hyphen (U+2010 Hyphen) - only when surrounded by ordinary spaces
 |236@ ~|236D~
| single "hard" hyphen (U+2011 Non-breaking hyphen) - only when surrounded by ordinary spaces
 |236A ~|236D~
| single figure dash (U+2012 Figure dash) - only when surrounded by ordinary spaces
 |236B ~|236D~
| single en dash (U+2013 En dash) - only when surrounded by ordinary spaces
 |236C ~|236D~
| double (ordinary) hyphen - in any context; remove ordinary spaces if surrounding
 -- ~|236D~
--~|236D~
| em dash - remove ordinary spaces if surrounding
 |236D ~|236D~